---
layout: base.njk
title: "Cashless & Insurance — DHS Multispecialty Hospital Ahmedabad"
description: "DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers cashless treatment with major insurance companies and TPA partners. Check our empaneled insurance providers."
canonical: "https://dhshospitals.com/cashless/"
activePage: "more"
---

<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Cashless & Insurance</h1>
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Cashless</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <p style="text-align:center;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 40px;color:var(--text-light)">DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers Mediclaim & Cashless services from major insurance companies for patient's ease. Contact our billing department at <a href="tel:{{ site.phones.billing }}">{{ site.phones.billing }}</a> for assistance.</p>

    <h2 class="section-title">Insurance Companies</h2>
    <div class="insurance-grid" style="margin-bottom:50px">
      {% for company in insurance.companies %}
      <div class="insurance-card">
        <img src="{{ company.image }}" alt="{{ company.name }}" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">TPA Partners</h2>
    <div class="insurance-grid">
      {% for tpa in insurance.tpa_partners %}
      <div class="insurance-card">
        <img src="{{ tpa.image }}" alt="{{ tpa.name }}" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
